@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@coachToken = REPLACE_WITH_COACH_TOKEN
@teamId = 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555

### Existing roster behavior: removed entries excluded
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/teams/{{teamId}}/roster
Authorization: Bearer {{coachToken}}

### Print/all-player views: all memberships, including inactive/removed entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/teams/{{teamId}}/roster?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{coachToken}}

### Invalid flag returns 400 for authorized callers
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/teams/{{teamId}}/roster?includeInactive=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{coachToken}}

### No token returns 401; an unassigned team with a coach token returns 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/teams/{{teamId}}/roster?includeInactive=true
